# script; default 831), the Leypoint (no script; default LEYPOINT). Ode to the Serpents not held: Talhaal: not
# available: 256; Ode completed (a GM): 256. Ode accepted (GMs): available: the Leypoint's trade of the medal: nil;
# Talhaal 282, finished on option 1: begun (any option); Talhaal again: no accepted handler: 256. Prog 0: the
# Leypoint's trade of the medal: nil; Fari-Wari 884 (beats Ode's 891), finished: Prog 1. Prog 1: Fari-Wari: Ode's 891.
# The Leypoint: the arrow: nil; the medal and the arrow: nil; at Prog 2 (a GM): the medal: nil; Prog 1 again: the
